# PowerCoach Studio — Project Overview

Multi-platform **Flutter/Dart** app (Android, iOS, web, Windows, macOS) for gym coaches. Coaches manage clients, assign workout plans, track measurements, and view schedules.

## Stack

| Concern | Technology |
|---------|-----------|
| Language | Dart (SDK ^3.9.2), Flutter |
| Auth & remote DB | Supabase (`supabase_flutter ^2.5.0`) |
| REST API | GymBlog.API via **Dio** (`GYMBLOG_API_URL` in `.env`) |
| Local DB (offline) | **Drift** + SQLite (`powercoach_offline.sqlite`) |
| DI | `get_it` — single `getIt` instance in `lib/core/di/service_locator.dart` |
| Routing | `go_router ^17` — defined in `lib/app.dart` |
| Monitoring | `sentry_flutter` (opt-in via `SENTRY_DSN` in `.env`) |
| i18n | Flutter ARB — primary locale **Italian (`it`)**, secondary English |
| Theme | Material 3, dark mode default — `StitchM3Theme` in `lib/theme/stitch_m3_theme.dart` |

## Key Entry Points

- `lib/main.dart` — bootstrap: dotenv → Supabase → Sentry → DI → SyncOrchestrator → `runApp`
- `lib/app.dart` — GoRouter definition and auth redirect guard
- `lib/core/di/service_locator.dart` — DI registrations (`GymBlogApiClient`)
- `lib/core/sync/sync_orchestrator.dart` — offline sync lifecycle

## Feature Modules (`lib/features/`)

`auth` · `landing` · `dashboard` · `customers` · `workouts` · `exercise_library` · `settings`

Each feature follows: `presentation/screens/` + optionally `data/` and `domain/`.

## Environment Variables (`.env` asset)

`GYMBLOG_API_URL` — base URL for GymBlog.API  
`SUPABASE_URL` / `SUPABASE_ANON_KEY` — Supabase credentials  
`SENTRY_DSN` — optional Sentry DSN
